{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GqDev2JtXswRxec2ndCFcz","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have a comprehensive understanding. Let me create a detailed summary report of my findings.\n\n## Comprehensive Codebase Analysis Report\n\nBased on my thorough exploration of the Roundnet codebase, here's everything you need to know for building the educational content public page:\n\n---\n\n## 1. DATABASE SCHEMA FOR EDUCATIONAL CONTENT (US-013)\n\n**File Path:** `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/supabase/migrations/20260202200000_create_educational_content_table.sql`\n\n**Schema Details:**\n```sql\nTable: public.educational_content\n- id: UUID (primary key)\n- title_es: text (Spanish title)\n- title_en: text (English title)\n- content_es: text (Spanish content)\n- content_en: text (English content)\n- category: enum ('rules', 'formats', 'general_info', 'videos')\n- video_url: text (nullable - for video content)\n- sort_order: integer (for ordering, default 0)\n- created_at: timestamptz (auto-generated)\n\nIndexes:\n- educational_content_category_idx on (category)\n- educational_content_sort_order_idx on (sort_order)\n\nRLS Policies:\n- Public read access (anyone can read)\n- Admin write/update/delete (currently disabled, all writes via service_role)\n```\n\n**Key Points:**\n- Fully bilingual (ES/EN)\n- Supports 4 content categories: rules, formats, general_info, videos\n- Includes optional video_url field for hosting video links\n- Public read access enabled via RLS\n\n---\n\n## 2. EXISTING PAGE STRUCTURE & ROUTING PATTERNS\n\n**Locale-Based Routing Pattern:**\n\nThe app uses Next.js 16 with `next-intl` for internationalization. All pages follow this pattern:\n\n```\n/src/app/[locale]/[page-name]/\n├── page.tsx (server component wrapper)\n└── [page-name]-content.tsx (client component with logic)\n```\n\n**Example Pattern from existing pages:**\n\n```typescript\n// page.tsx (Server Component)\nimport { setRequestLocale } from \"next-intl/server\";\nimport { PageContent } from \"./page-content\";\n\nexport default async function Page({\n  params,\n}: {\n  params: Promise<{ locale: string }>;\n}) {\n  const { locale } = await params;\n  setRequestLocale(locale);\n  return <PageContent />;\n}\n```\n\n**Layout Structure:**\n```typescript\n// /src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx\n- NextIntlClientProvider wraps all content\n- Header component (navigation with locale support)\n- {children} (page content)\n- Footer component\n- Geist Sans/Mono fonts from Google Fonts\n```\n\n**Existing Public Pages:**\n- `/[locale]` - Home page\n- `/[locale]/login` - Login page\n- `/[locale]/register` - Registration page\n- `/[locale]/profile` - User profile (authenticated)\n- `/[locale]/complete-profile` - Profile completion flow\n\n**File Paths:**\n- Root layout: `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx`\n- Home page: `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/app/[locale]/page.tsx`\n- Header: `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/components/header.tsx`\n- Footer: `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/components/footer.tsx`\n\n---\n\n## 3. UI COMPONENTS LIBRARY (shadcn/ui)\n\n**Configuration File:** `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/components.json`\n\n**Library Details:**\n- Using **shadcn/ui** components (style: \"new-york\")\n- Built on **Radix UI** primitives\n- **Lucide React** for icons\n- **Tailwind CSS v4** for styling\n- **React Hook Form** for form management\n- **Zod** for schema validation\n\n**Available Components:**\n```\n/src/components/ui/\n├── button.tsx (Button with variants: default, destructive, outline, secondary, ghost, link)\n├── input.tsx (Text input)\n├── label.tsx (Form label)\n└── form.tsx (React Hook Form integration)\n```\n\n**Component Patterns:**\n\nButton variants and sizes:\n```typescript\nvariant: \"default\" | \"destructive\" | \"outline\" | \"secondary\" | \"ghost\" | \"link\"\nsize: \"default\" | \"xs\" | \"sm\" | \"lg\" | \"icon\" | \"icon-xs\" | \"icon-sm\" | \"icon-lg\"\n```\n\n**CSS Variables Approach:**\n- Uses OKLch color space for design tokens\n- CSS custom properties for theming\n- Dark mode support via `.dark` class\n- Responsive utilities built into Tailwind v4\n\n---\n\n## 4. EXISTING PAGE STRUCTURES & LAYOUTS\n\n**Profile Page Pattern** (`/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/app/[locale]/profile/profile-content.tsx`):\n- Server-side auth check with redirect if not authenticated\n- Responsive container with max-w-2xl\n- Multiple card sections with icons and labels\n- Form sections using FormField/FormControl pattern\n- Error/success messages with color-coded backgrounds\n- Loading states with Loader2 spinner icons\n\n**Login/Register Pattern** (`/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/app/[locale]/login/login-content.tsx`):\n- Centered layout with max-w-md width\n- Title + subtitle sections\n- Card-based form container\n- Link to alternate auth page\n- Uses dedicated form components\n\n**Component Composition Pattern:**\n```typescript\n- Page wrapper: full-height container\n- Content: centered or max-width limited\n- Sections: divided by visual cards with borders\n- Icons: Lucide React icons with consistent sizing\n- Spacing: py-8, px-4 for responsive padding\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. INTERNATIONALIZATION (i18n) SETUP\n\n**Configuration Files:**\n\n**`/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/i18n/config.ts`:**\n```typescript\nexport const locales = ['es', 'en'] as const;\nexport const defaultLocale = 'es' as const;\n```\n\n**`/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/i18n/routing.ts`:**\n```typescript\nimport { defineRouting } from 'next-intl/routing';\nexport const routing = defineRouting({\n  locales,\n  defaultLocale,\n});\n```\n\n**`/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/i18n/request.ts`:**\n```typescript\nexport default getRequestConfig(async ({ requestLocale }) => {\n  let locale = await requestLocale;\n  return {\n    locale,\n    messages: (await import(`../../messages/${locale}.json`)).default,\n  };\n});\n```\n\n**Middleware:** `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/middleware.ts`\n```typescript\nimport createMiddleware from 'next-intl/middleware';\nexport default createMiddleware(routing);\n// Matches: '/((?!api|auth|_next|_vercel|.*\\..*).*)'\n```\n\n**Translation Files:**\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/messages/en.json`\n- `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/messages/es.json`\n\n**Current Translation Keys Structure:**\n```json\n{\n  \"common\": { \"language\", \"spanish\", \"english\" },\n  \"nav\": { \"home\", \"educational\", \"tournaments\", \"training\", \"rankings\", \"bulkOrders\", \"menu\", \"closeMenu\" },\n  \"auth\": { \"login\", \"logout\", \"profile\", \"register\", ... },\n  \"footer\": { \"rights\", \"privacy\", \"terms\", \"contact\" },\n  \"home\": { \"title\", \"description\", ... },\n  \"profile\": { \"title\", \"profileInfo\", ... },\n  \"metadata\": { \"title\", \"description\" }\n}\n```\n\n**Usage Pattern in Components:**\n```typescript\n// Server components\nimport { getMessages, setRequestLocale } from \"next-intl/server\";\nsetRequestLocale(locale);\n\n// Client components\nimport { useTranslations, useLocale } from \"next-intl\";\nconst t = useTranslations(\"section\");\nconst locale = useLocale();\n```\n\n---\n\n## 6. VIDEO PLAYER IMPLEMENTATIONS\n\n**Current Status:** No existing video player component in the codebase.\n\n**Available Dependencies:**\n- No video player library installed (not in package.json)\n\n**Available for Implementation:**\n```json\nDependencies:\n- lucide-react (icons for controls)\n- react-hook-form (if needed for player settings)\n- tailwindcss (styling)\n```\n\n**Recommended Video Player Options:**\n1. **HTML5 Video Element** - Native, lightweight, works with video_url field\n2. **react-player** - Multi-format support (would need to add)\n3. **Vidstack** - Modern, accessible player (would need to add)\n\n**Current Storage Pattern:**\n- Educational content table has `video_url` field\n- Supports external video URLs (YouTube, Vimeo, etc.)\n- Could support video hosting via Supabase Storage\n\n---\n\n## 7. SUPABASE CLIENT CONFIGURATION\n\n**File:** `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/lib/supabase.ts`\n\n```typescript\nimport { createClient } from '@supabase/supabase-js'\n\nconst supabaseUrl = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL\nconst supabaseAnonKey = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY\n\nexport const supabase = createClient(supabaseUrl, supabaseAnonKey)\n```\n\n**Environment Variables:**\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`\n\n**Usage Pattern:**\n```typescript\n// Fetching data\nconst { data, error } = await supabase\n  .from(\"educational_content\")\n  .select(\"*\")\n  .eq(\"category\", \"rules\")\n  .order(\"sort_order\", { ascending: true })\n\n// Auth checks\nconst { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()\n```\n\n---\n\n## 8. DESIGN SYSTEM & STYLING\n\n**Tailwind Configuration:**\n- Custom CSS variables for all design tokens\n- OKLch color space with oklch() functions\n- Dark mode support via .dark class\n- Responsive breakpoints: sm, md, lg, xl\n- Padding/margin utilities: px-4, py-8, gap-6, etc.\n\n**Common CSS Patterns in Codebase:**\n```typescript\n// Container\n\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-2xl\"\n\n// Full height sections\n\"flex min-h-[calc(100vh-8rem)] items-center justify-center\"\n\n// Cards\n\"rounded-lg border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm\"\n\n// Buttons\n\"rounded-md bg-primary px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90\"\n\n// Text hierarchy\n\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight\" // h1\n\"text-xl font-semibold\" // h2\n\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\" // labels\n\n// Spacing patterns\n\"space-y-4\" // vertical gap between children\n\"gap-4\" or \"gap-6\" // flex gap\n```\n\n---\n\n## 9. HEADER & NAVIGATION PATTERNS\n\n**File:** `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/components/header.tsx` (225 lines)\n\n**Features:**\n- Sticky header with z-50\n- Logo + brand name\n- Desktop navigation (hidden on mobile)\n- Navigation items loop through array:\n  ```typescript\n  const navItems = [\n    { key: \"educational\", href: \"/educational\" },\n    { key: \"tournaments\", href: \"/tournaments\" },\n    { key: \"training\", href: \"/training\" },\n    { key: \"rankings\", href: \"/rankings\" },\n    { key: \"bulkOrders\", href: \"/bulk-orders\" },\n  ]\n  ```\n- Mobile hamburger menu with smooth height transitions\n- Auth status detection (loading, authenticated, unauthenticated)\n- Language switcher integration\n- Responsive design with md: breakpoint\n\n---\n\n## 10. FOOTER PATTERNS\n\n**File:** `/Users/anayusta/workspace/roundnet/src/components/footer.tsx` (93 lines)\n\n**Structure:**\n- 3-column grid layout (md:grid-cols-3)\n- Brand section with logo\n- Navigation section (loops through navItems)\n- Legal links section (privacy, terms, contact)\n- Copyright with current year\n- Language and locale-aware links\n\n---\n\n## 11. KEY DEVELOPMENT PATTERNS\n\n**Async Server Components:**\n```typescript\nexport default async function Page({\n  params,\n}: {\n  params: Promise<{ locale: string }>;\n}) {\n  const { locale } = await params;\n  setRequestLocale(locale);\n  return <Content />;\n}\n```\n\n**Client Component Form Handling:**\n```typescript\nconst form = useForm<FormValues>({\n  resolver: zodResolver(schema),\n  defaultValues: {...},\n});\n\nconst onSubmit = async (values: FormValues) => {\n  setIsSubmitting(true);\n  try {\n    // API call\n    setSuccess(\"Success message\");\n  } catch {\n    setError(\"Error message\");\n  } finally {\n    setIsSubmitting(false);\n  }\n};\n```\n\n**Locale-aware Links:**\n```typescript\nhref={`/${locale}/educational`}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 12. PROJECT STRUCTURE SUMMARY\n\n```\n/src\n├── /app\n│   ├── /[locale]\n│   │   ├── /layout.tsx (root locale layout)\n│   │   ├── /page.tsx (home page)\n│   │   ├── /[route]\n│   │   │   ├── /page.tsx (page wrapper)\n│   │   │   └── /[route]-content.tsx (client component)\n│   │   └── /api (API routes)\n│   └── /auth (OAuth callbacks)\n├── /components\n│   ├── /ui (shadcn components)\n│   ├── header.tsx\n│   ├── footer.tsx\n│   └── [feature]-form.tsx\n├── /i18n\n│   ├── config.ts\n│   ├── routing.ts\n│   └── request.ts\n├── /lib\n│   ├── supabase.ts\n│   └── utils.ts\n└── /middleware.ts\n\n/messages\n├── en.json\n└── es.json\n\n/supabase\n└── /migrations\n    ├── 20260202000000_create_profiles_table.sql\n    ├── 20260202100000_create_shadow_players_table.sql\n    └── 20260202200000_create_educational_content_table.sql\n```\n\n---\n\n## 13. READY-TO-USE SNIPPETS FOR EDUCATIONAL PAGE\n\n**Database Query Pattern:**\n```typescript\nconst { data: content, error } = await supabase\n  .from(\"educational_content\")\n  .select(\"*\")\n  .eq(\"category\", \"rules\")\n  .order(\"sort_order\", { ascending: true })\n```\n\n**Component Layout Pattern:**\n```typescript\n<div className=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-4xl\">\n  <h1 className=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8\">{t(\"title\")}</h1>\n  \n  <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n    {/* Content cards here */}\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n**Translation Namespace:**\nAdd to `/messages/en.json` and `/messages/es.json`:\n```json\n{\n  \"educational\": {\n    \"title\": \"Educational Content\",\n    \"rules\": \"Rules\",\n    \"formats\": \"Formats\",\n    \"generalInfo\": \"General Information\",\n    \"videos\": \"Videos\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\nThis comprehensive analysis provides all the foundational knowledge needed to build the educational content public page following the established patterns and architecture of the Roundnet application."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a54d398 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"390ca8d4-cf33-40e5-867b-fd8aefb9a312","uuid":"31aa9b77-6373-411b-919d-c0f03809ecd0","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the codebase to 